<p id="Sx8.I10.ix1.I1.ix4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">All datasets drawn from the existing literature (potentially including authors’ own previously published work) are accompanied by appropriate citations (yes/no/NA) <span id="Sx8.I10.ix1.I1.ix4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">
yes</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx8.I10.ix1.I1.ix5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.6.</span> 
<div id="Sx8.I10.ix1.I1.ix5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx8.I10.ix1.I1.ix5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">All datasets drawn from the existing literature (potentially including authors’ own previously published work) are publicly available (yes/partial/no/NA) <span id="Sx8.I10.ix1.I1.ix5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">
yes</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="Sx8.I10.ix1.I1.ix6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.7.</span> 
